# Exam track — Theme: De Stot — Sub-lesson 1: Vocabulary
# Sproochentest oral-exam topic. Target level ~B1 (authoring guideline only).
#
# Sentences are grounded in the user's real answers, gathered by interview —
# do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass.
#
# Handout corrections applied after LOD verification: Hinderniss → Hindernis,
# verstëbst → stëbseg, de Mopp → d'Mopp (LOD gives it as feminine).

@lesson W1.01 "Household Vocabulary"

@word de Stot = the household chores
@word d'Hausaarbecht = the housework
@word d'Aufgab = the task
@word d'Wäsch = the laundry
@word d'Geschier = the dishes
@word d'Buedzëmmer = the bathroom
@word de Buedem = the floor
@word d'Bett = the bed
@word den Dësch = the table
@word de Dreck = the dirt
@word de Stëbs = the dust
@word d'Spullmaschinn = the dishwasher
@word de Staubsauger = the vacuum cleaner
