@word ausraumen = to unload
@word ophänken = to hang up
@word eraushänken = to hang outside
@word falen = to fold
@word nätzen = to water
@word erausdroen = to carry outside
@word opbotzen = to mop up

@sentence
@lu Ech maache mäi Bett all Moien.
@en I make my bed every morning.
@distractor-lu Dësch
@distractor-lu owes
@distractor-en table
@distractor-en evening

@sentence
@lu Meng Fra an ech deelen eis de Stot.
@en My wife and I share the household chores.
@distractor-lu Gaart
